# Route: guide 35 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 54 to
# 56, 65 quests, 4.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Ironforge, Searing Gorge, Elwynn Forest): Sorrow
# Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp ->
# Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave
# -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Sorrow
# Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric
# the Black 52, Obsidion 52).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848),
# Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Mythology of the
# Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost Tablets of Will
# (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace (2204), The Lost
# Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential Artificials (2924),
# The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929), Data Rescue (2930),
# Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate of the Kingdom
# (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394), An Ancient
# Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms (96403),
# The Treaty of Understanding (98423), A Crumpled Up Note (4264), Blackhand's
